Fedora Xfce Minimal Setup
==========================

A simple bash script to set up a minimal Fedora Xfce workstation. The focus is on building
a sleek, security-hardened system that retains functionality as a daily driver.

It’s designed to build on the smallest Fedora installation possible — ideally from the
Everything ISO. Just install the default "Custom Operating System" then clone this repo into
the user directory and run the script. It’ll pull in a minimal set of Xfce and app packages,
drop in some hardened configs, and set up the desktop environment.

Any file in the 'configs' or 'dotfiles' directories can be edited, added, or removed without
touching the script. The only required file is 'packages'. The 'excludes' file can be
safely deleted.

Fedora Everything: https://fedoraproject.org/misc#everything

Xfce Desktop Environment: https://xfce.org/

